    2621: aaload
    2622: bipush        31
    2624: ldc_w         #606                // String The Golden Knight says \"I wonder how you were able to come so far. I will make sure you go no further. I will humiliate you 10 times as much as you\'ve disgraced this tower. Ghost Soldiers, charge!\"
    2627: aastore
