    2790: bipush        38
    2792: ldc_w         #620                // String The Magic Serg. Zeno replies \"You weren\'t? I dare you to say that again. You come running up here like a coward and tell me you couldn\'t do your job. What shame! This tower has no need for the likes of you! You\'ve failed me for the last time. You shall now die.\"
    2795: aastore
